[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的心中还留有一个疑问。|#0102Adv28_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为此，她在回房前<br>匆忙去了趟娱乐室。|#0102Adv28_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:-2,0 Zoom:0.3 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

; キャビネットを鍵で開く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_107 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:她走到收纳柜前，<br>用米莉亚的钥匙打开柜子。|#0102Adv28_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:里面放了许多影片。<br>这点在她的意料之内。|#0102Adv28_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（但是，说不定还有其他的东西——）|#0102Adv28_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她在影片堆里翻找了一会，<br>终于发现了【那个东西】。|#0102Adv28_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
; ☆証拠品：『牢屋敷設計図』入手
@ResetText
@ShowToastUI Text:"魔女图鉴 更新…|#Toast_001|"
@UpdateWitchBook Id:Blueprint Category:Map Version:1
@UpdateWitchBook Id:3-3 Category:Clue Version:1
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:3-3
@Wait WaitMode:i1.2
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true
[PrintTextModified Text:那是一张监牢的设计图纸，<br>看上去有些年代。|#0102Adv28_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:翻到设计图的背面，<br>上面潦草地写着以前的囚犯留下的信息。|#0102Adv28_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:【在此记下逃脱方法】|#0102Adv28_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:纸上在离监牢稍远的湖泊附近，<br>画了一个“x”形标记。|#0102Adv28_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9
@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground Intensity:1.5 FadeDuration:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的心里点燃了一丝希望之光，<br>与此同时她热泪盈眶。|#0102Adv28_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:平时整天泡在娱乐室里看电影的米莉亚<br>不可能没找到这个。|#0102Adv28_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她也明白了，米莉亚吞下钥匙的意义。|#0102Adv28_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚和安安你的想法一样。<br>她也不想离开这里啊。|#0102Adv28_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这句话，<br>安安已经听不到了。|#0102Adv28_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground Intensity:0 FadeDuration:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走向门口，<br>在离开之前再一次回首。|#0102Adv28_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她仿佛看见了米莉亚和安安<br>十分亲密地坐在沙发上的幻影。|#0102Adv28_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

